Read the beginning of a story and write the ending (about 50 words).

> It was a rainy Saturday morning. Amina and her little brother were walking to the market when they heard a strange noise behind a shop. They went closer and looked behind the shop.

Your ending must:
- be written in the past tense;
- use at least TWO connectors of time (for example *suddenly*, *then*, *after that*, *finally*);
- say how Amina felt at the end of the story.
